`writeWorkbook` is imported but only `workbookOf` is used (because writeWorkbook calls downloadBlob → file-saver → DOM). So I'll test `workbookOf` with both shapes (that's where asSheet is used now in both).

Add before the final console.log:
```js
const pairWb = workbookOf(XLSX, [['A', [['x']]], ['B', [['y']]]]);
const objWb = workbookOf(XLSX, [{ name: 'A', aoa: [['x']] }, { name: 'B', aoa: [['y']] }]);
t('workbookOf 两种形状产出同一个工作簿（spec 用对象、模板用数组对）',
  JSON.stringify(objWb.SheetNames) === JSON.stringify(pairWb.SheetNames) &&
  objWb.SheetNames.length === 2);
t('导出任务的 sheets 是对象形，L1 必须吃得下（曾炸 .for is not iterable）', (() => {
  const keys = Object.keys(objWb.Sheets.A).filter(k => !k.startsWith('!'));
  return keys.includes('a1') && objWb.Sheets.B['!ref'] !== undefined;
})());
```
Hmm, also verify writeWorkbook doesn't throw for object form. writeWorkbook calls downloadBlob → import('file-saver') → saveAs(blob, name) in Node → file-saver may fail (needs document). Risky. Skip writeWorkbook, use workbookOf (same code path for the loop).

That gives 60 items. Let me add them.

